nauthorized occupations and connections. Residents have requested a six-month notice for plot owners to start construction or face eviction.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/infrastructure/many-vacant-plots-encroached-indirapuram-residents-write-to-ghaziabad-development-body-demand-action/134887887?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-190882/134887887.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "infrastructure"}]}